From 2dc0726fc49a912321bd13a9ae51718bf697f5c8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mini <mini@local>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 03:37:38 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 06/10] Capture macOS shell env with sentinel framing and open
 git repos asynchronously

Frames /usr/bin/env -0 output with a unique sentinel and skips non-UTF-8
entries cleanly, avoids permanently pinning GUI repos to /usr/bin/git or
triggering Xcode CLT prompts before login env loads, caches directory
environments via OnceLock, upgrades repo git binary/env asynchronously,
and adds rename-following file_path_at_commit().
